 new places with friends, solve interactive puzzles or form teams to compete in action-packed games. You can even design worlds of your own or get to know other members of the community and be inspired by their creations. In Horizon, you're not just a visitor. You're part of what makes it great.\n\nTo join the beta waitlist, please visit http://www.oculus.com/facebook-horizon", "short_description": "Facebook Horizon is a social experience where you can explore, play and create. In Horizon, you\u2019re not just a visitor. You're part of what makes it great. To join the beta waitlist, please visit http://www.oculus.com/facebook-horizon"}]}, "developer_name": "Facebook", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.oculus.com/legal/horizon-data-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.oculus.com/legal/horizon-terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Facebook", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.oculus.com/facebookhorizon", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1725996564472128"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EXPLORATION", "SOCIAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "4946157685469273"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1107161812971898"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1107161812971898"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1585952880, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "11071618